  "summary": "Malicious code in @khaznatech/common (npm)",
  "details": "@khaznatech/common@99.0.0 is a dependency-confusion stub (scoped name, version 99.0.0, ~1.2KB bundle) whose preinstall hook runs install-report.js. On install it sends the victim's hostname and the current working directory to the webhook[.]site endpoint hxxps://webhook[.]site/93b065ab-227f-4253-b940-361d00e9b870/ via an outbound HTTPS GET, exfiltrating host metadata to an attacker-controlled webhook collector.",
